{"seq":3,"slug":"heat-treatment","title":"大学材料科学 — 热处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/materials-science/metallic-materials/heat-treatment","wordCount":1609,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学材料科学-热处理\">大学材料科学 — 热处理</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>热处理是通过控制加热温度、保温时间和冷却速率来改变金属内部组织结构，从而获得所需性能的工艺方法。对于钢铁材料而言，热处理是连接成分设计与最终性能的关键桥梁，也是机械制造中最重要的工序之一。本节系统讲解钢的各类热处理工艺原理及其对组织性能的影响。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ttt-图与-cct-图\">TTT 图与 CCT 图</h3><p><strong>TTT 图</strong>（Time-Temperature-Transformation，等温转变图）描述过冷奥氏体在不同恒温下的转变产物和转变时间。图形通常呈 C 形或双 C 形，&quot;鼻尖&quot;温度处转变速率最快。</p>\n<p><strong>CCT 图</strong>（Continuous Cooling Transformation，连续冷却转变图）更贴近实际热处理工艺，描述连续冷却条件下的组织演变。CCT 曲线相比 TTT 曲线向右下方偏移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"奥氏体化\">奥氏体化</h3><p>所有热处理的起点是将钢加热到奥氏体区（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{c3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30 \\sim 50°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>），使碳和合金元素充分溶入奥氏体。</p>\n<p>奥氏体晶粒尺寸对后续转变产物有重要影响——细小的奥氏体晶粒有利于获得细小的转变组织。实际生产中通过控制加热温度和保温时间来调控奥氏体晶粒度。AlN、TiN 等微细颗粒可以钉扎晶界、抑制晶粒长大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退火与正火\">退火与正火</h3><p><strong>退火（Annealing）</strong> 是将钢加热到奥氏体区后随炉缓冷，目的是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>消除铸造或加工的残余应力</li>\n<li>降低硬度、改善切削加工性</li>\n<li>获得接近平衡态的组织</li>\n</ul>\n<p>完全退火后，亚共析钢获得铁素体 + 珠光体，过共析钢获得珠光体 + 球状渗碳体（球化退火）。</p>\n<p><strong>正火（Normalizing）</strong> 与退火类似，但冷却方式为空冷。冷却速度快于退火，获得更细的珠光体（索氏体），强度和硬度略高。正火常用于统一锻件组织和消除魏氏组织。</p>\n<h3 id=\"淬火\">淬火</h3><p>淬火是将钢从奥氏体区快速冷却（水淬、油淬或空冷），抑制珠光体和贝氏体转变，使奥氏体直接转变为<strong>马氏体</strong>。</p>\n<p>马氏体是碳在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>-Fe 中的过饱和固溶体，呈体心正方（BCT）结构，正方度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c/a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 随碳含量增加而增大：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.046</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>wt</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c}{a} = 1 + 0.046 \\times \\text{wt}\\%\\,\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.046</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">wt</span></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>马氏体的高硬度主要来源于碳原子对位错运动的强烈阻碍（固溶强化）以及相变产生的高密度位错。</p>\n<p>马氏体转变是无扩散型相变，具有以下特征：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有确定的起始温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和终了温度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>转变量仅取决于冷却到的温度，与时间无关</li>\n<li>转变伴随体积膨胀（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span>），可能导致淬火裂纹</li>\n</ul>\n<p>碳含量对马氏体硬度的影响：低碳马氏体（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 0.2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2%</span></span></span></span></span> C）呈板条状，韧性较好；高碳马氏体（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 0.6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6%</span></span></span></span></span> C）呈片状或针状，硬度极高但脆性大。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回火\">回火</h3><p>淬火马氏体处于亚稳态，脆性大，必须通过回火调整性能。回火是将淬火钢在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{c1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以下加热保温后冷却的工艺。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回火温度</th>\n<th>组织</th>\n<th>性能特点</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>250</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150 \\sim 250°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">250°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>回火马氏体</td>\n<td>高硬度，保留耐磨性</td>\n<td>刀具、量具、轴承</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>350</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">350 \\sim 500°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>回火托氏体</td>\n<td>高弹性极限</td>\n<td>弹簧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>650</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500 \\sim 650°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">650°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>回火索氏体</td>\n<td>强度-韧性最佳配合</td>\n<td>轴、齿轮、连杆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>调质处理</strong>（淬火 + 高温回火）是获得综合力学性能的最常用热处理组合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"表面处理\">表面处理</h3><p>许多零件需要&quot;表硬心韧&quot;——表面高硬度耐磨，心部保持韧性。</p>\n<p><strong>渗碳</strong>：将低碳钢（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.10 \\sim 0.25\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25%</span></span></span></span></span> C）放入富碳介质中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>900</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>950</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">900 \\sim 950°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">900</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">950°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 保温，碳原子向内扩散形成高碳表层。渗碳层深度由 Fick 第二定律控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≈</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\approx \\sqrt{Dt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0645em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>渗碳后淬火 + 低温回火，表面硬度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>58</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>62</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>HRC</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">58 \\sim 62\\,\\text{HRC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">58</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">62</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HRC</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>渗氮（氮化）</strong>：在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>570</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500 \\sim 570°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">570°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的含氮气氛中处理，氮原子与 Al、Cr、Mo 形成极硬的氮化物层（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>HV</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 1000\\,\\text{HV}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HV</span></span></span></span></span></span>），温度低不变形，但处理时间长（数十小时）。</p>\n<p><strong>感应加热淬火</strong>：利用交变电磁场在工件表面产生涡流加热，仅表层奥氏体化后快速冷却获得马氏体。加热深度由电流频率控制，高频浅层、中频较深。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在 45 钢的 CCT 图上画出水淬、油淬和空冷三条冷却曲线，预测各自的最终组织。</li>\n<li>为什么高碳钢淬火后必须及时回火？从内应力和回火脆性角度分析。</li>\n<li>比较渗碳和渗氮两种表面硬化工艺的优缺点，说明各自适用的零件类型。</li>\n<li>某 40Cr 钢轴需要表面硬度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>HRC</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55\\,\\text{HRC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HRC</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上、心部冲击韧性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>J</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 60\\,\\text{J}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">J</span></span></span></span></span></span>。设计完整的热处理工艺路线。</li>\n<li>马氏体转变为什么被称为&quot;无扩散型&quot;相变？它与珠光体转变的本质区别是什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Thelning,《Steel and Its Heat Treatment》系统介绍了工业热处理的原理与工艺</li>\n<li>热处理模拟软件（如 DANTE、SYSWELD）可以预测淬火变形和残余应力分布，是现代热处理工艺设计的重要工具</li>\n<li>贝氏体转变是介于珠光体和马氏体之间的重要转变类型——了解上贝氏体和下贝氏体的组织特征与力学性能差异</li>\n<li>先进热处理技术：真空热处理、等温淬火（获得贝氏体）、深冷处理（消除残余奥氏体）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>热处理通过控制奥氏体的转变路径来调控钢的最终组织和性能。退火和正火获得接近平衡的组织，淬火通过抑制扩散型转变获得马氏体，回火则在保留强度的同时恢复韧性。TTT 和 CCT 图是选择热处理参数的核心工具，而表面热处理技术则实现了零件不同部位的差异化性能设计。热处理与合金成分设计相结合，构成了金属材料性能调控的完整体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学材料科学 — 热处理","id":"大学材料科学-热处理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"TTT 图与 CCT 图","id":"ttt-图与-cct-图"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"奥氏体化","id":"奥氏体化"},{"level":3,"text":"退火与正火","id":"退火与正火"},{"level":3,"text":"淬火","id":"淬火"},{"level":3,"text":"回火","id":"回火"},{"level":3,"text":"表面处理","id":"表面处理"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学材料科学 — 有色金属","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/materials-science/metallic-materials/non-ferrous-metals"},"next":{"title":"大学材料科学 — 高分子科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/materials-science/polymers-ceramics/polymer-science"}}